abstract: >-
  A collection of agent skills adapted for Cline on Windows: report writing for
  Russian university coursework, offline prompt-injection scanning, diagram
  generation, and document, spreadsheet and presentation tooling. Skills are
  vendored from several upstream projects at pinned commits; see upstream.json.
